    "created_at": "2026-03-02T17:51:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T17:52:54Z",
    "body": "Doesn't https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-a-modulepreload-module-script-graph already handle this? The original script fetch was already outside of a module for script preloads prior to https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11981.\n\nThe default \"javascript-or-wasm\" shouldn't matter due to [module type from module request](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#module-type-from-module-request).\n\nNote that JSON and style modules are always leaf nodes currently, so they can't fetch other modules.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
